},"家族内に長期臥床または重度の障害がある人がいる場合、加入先の医療保険部門へ長期介護保険を申請してください。これは高齢者だけに支給されるものではありません"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/17-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"家族内に長期臥床の人がいる場合、褥瘡（床ずれ）を最大の敵と見なしましょう：電動エアマットレスの使用、定期的な体位変換、毎日、骨の突出部をチェックする"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/17-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"高齢者の白内障が視界に影響しているなら、眼科で手術の検討を。両目に症状がある場合は、二枚目の手術をあまり遅らせないこと"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/17-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"高齢者の犬の散歩ではリードを手に巻かず手のひらで握り、短く保つ。引っ張って飛び出さないよう犬を訓練する"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"現在地"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/book"},"children":["本を読む"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/book/17"},"children":["第17章"," ·"," ","家族に高齢者がいる場合"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"17-01"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["01"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-a"},"children":["エビデンス"," ","A"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"ja"},"children":["高齢なうちに、将来の後見人を書面で指定しておく"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"ja","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["意識がはっきりしているうちに、数百元をかけて公証役場へ行き、将来誰が後見人になるかを明記した書面を作成しておきましょう。この書面がないと、本人が自ら決定できなくなった際、誰が代理署名し、誰が財産を管理するかを裁判所が指定することになります。家族間で意見が一致しない場合、手続きはさらに長期化してしまいます。"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["費用・手間"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["公証役場での手続きは数百元程度です。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["効果"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["民法典の規定により、意識がはっきりしており、自ら決定を下せる成人（法律上は「完全な民事行為能力を有する成人」）は、将来の自分の後見人をあらかじめ他者と協議して決めておくことができます。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"記録する：高齢なうちに、将来の後見人を書面で指定しておく"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"できている"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"やることに追加"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"お気に入り"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"このヒントを共有"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"詳細を閉じる"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["費用・手間"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["公証役場での手続きは数百元程度です。本人と一度話し合えば決まります。難しいのは切り出し方です。将来、自分自身で判断ができなくなる日が来ることを、直接伝えなければなりません。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["効果"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["民法典の規定により、意識がはっきりしており、自ら決定を下せる成人（法律上は「完全な民事行為能力を有する成人」）は、将来の自分の後見人をあらかじめ他者と協議して決めておくことができます。協議の相手は、近親者だけでなく、後見人を引き受ける意思のある個人や組織でも可能です。協議の結果は「書面の形式で自分の後見人を確定させる」必要があります。将来、本人が決定を下せなくなった場合、あるいは一部の決定しかできなくなった場合（法律上は「民事行為能力の喪失または一部喪失」）、あらかじめ指定された人物が管理を行うことになります。この書面がない場合、将来誰が代理署名し、誰が財産を管理するかは、裁判所による指定手続きを経る必要があります。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["出典"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["全国人大 (2020). 民法典（第三十三条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.spp.gov.cn/spp/fl/202006/t20200602_463888.shtml","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.spp.gov.cn/spp/fl/202006/t20200602_463888.shtml"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.spp.gov.cn/spp/fl/202006/t20200602_463888.shtml","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["出典を開く"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["著者の注記"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["この書面は「意定監護（任意後見）」と呼ばれ、自分があらかじめ指定した人を意味します。この人物は、法律で定められた法定の監護順位よりも優先されます。高齢者が一人暮らしの場合、子供が遠方に住んでいる場合、あるいは家族関係が複雑な場合は、特に事前に行っておく必要があります。公証役場での公証を受けることをお勧めします。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["自分のメモ"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["自分へのメモを書く…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/ja/tip/17-02"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["次へ"]},"遺言を作成しましょう。後から作成したものが前のものを覆すため、公証遺言が優先されるとは限りません"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["このテーマの他の提案"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/17-03"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["高齢者の資金は別口座で管理し、高額支出には二人確認のルールを設ける"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["高齢者を狙う詐欺では、贈り物や親身な言葉で信頼を積み上げてから大金を奪います。「誰にも言わないで」と口止めするのも典型です。一定額以上の支…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/17-04"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["高齢者がいつでも使える、断るためのフレーズ：「家族と相談させてください」"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["勧誘や詐欺は、その場の圧力で考える前に払わせようとします。感情が高ぶると誇張広告を信じやすく、高齢者は若い人より説得されやすい傾向がありま…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/17-05"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["高齢者に先払いを求める「投資型老後プラン」には一切手を出さないこと：カード作成、ベッド確保、介護マンション、移住型老後生活、高齢者向け製品の購入は、すべて同一の違法集金の手口です"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["高齢者に先払いを求め、かつリターンを約束する老後プランは、すべて同じ詐欺の手口です。カード作成、ベッド確保、介護マンション、移住型老後生活…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/17-06"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["保険会社による住宅リバースモーゲージ型年金保険を除き、他の「自宅を活用した老後プラン」には一切手を出さないこと。絶対に住宅を担保に理財商品を買ってはいけない"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["正規の住宅を活用した老後プランは、保険会社による住宅リバースモーゲージ型年金保険（現在、試験運用中）のただ一種のみです。訪問販売されるもの…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/17-07"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["家族内に長期臥床または重度の障害がある人がいる場合、加入先の医療保険部門へ長期介護保険を申請してください。これは高齢者だけに支給されるものではありません"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["長期介護保険は、介護を依頼するための費用を補助してくれます。家族に重度の障害があり、半年以上継続している場合は、加入先の医療保険部門へ申請…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/ja/tip/17-08"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["家族内に長期臥床の人がいる場合、褥瘡（床ずれ）を最大の敵と見なしましょう：電動エアマットレスの使用、定期的な体位変換、毎日、骨の突出部をチェックする"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["股関節骨折の手術前に褥瘡がある高齢者は、30 日以内に亡くなる可能性が約2割高まります。電動エアマットレスに交換することで、新しい褥瘡がで…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/ja/book/17"},"children":["テーマ全体を読む：家族に高齢者がいる場合"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tabbar","aria-label":"メインナビゲーション"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/ja/book"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-book-open","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 7v14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"s